        "heading": "What are Federal Express's current contract totals?",
        "body": "Federal Express has $354M in obligations for FY2026 to date. Federal Express received 962 awards this fiscal year and the average award size is $368K. Federal Express obligations are down 39.2% year over year. Federal Express recorded $677M in FY24 and $582M in FY25."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are Federal Express's top federal customers?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $199M to Federal Express in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense obligated $135M to Federal Express in FY2026 to date. Other buyers include the Department of Justice at $7.7M, the Department of Agriculture at $3.6M, and the Department of Transportation at $3.6M."
      }
